cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Splink vs. Tilores — Reproducible Entity Resolution Benchmark"
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Hendrik
    family-names: Nehnes
    affiliation: "Tilo Tech GmbH"
    email: hello@tilores.io
repository-code: "https://github.com/tilotech/tilores-splink-benchmark"
url: "https://tilores.io"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible head-to-head benchmark comparing Splink (open-source
  entity resolution by the UK Ministry of Justice) and Tilores
  (commercial entity resolution API by Tilo Tech GmbH) on 1,000,000
  synthetic FEBRL records with 100,000 known ground-truth duplicate
  pairs. Reports precision, recall, F1, batch throughput, and real-time
  search latency.
keywords:
  - entity resolution
  - record linkage
  - deduplication
  - benchmark
  - splink
  - tilores
  - FEBRL
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-03"
